{"id":"543fc0f9565c5d6d","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-cofinality-measure.md","title":"Cofinality Measure","display":"df-cofinality-measure — Cofinality Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cofinality-measure","aliases":["58-df-cofinality-measure"],"display":"df-cofinality-measure — Cofinality Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cofinality-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cofinality-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cofinality-measure — Cofinality Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span> (cardinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (cofinality-measure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality-measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalityMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda=\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\lambda=\\min\\{|C|\\mid C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\sup C=\\kappa\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality-measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalityMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda=\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\lambda=\\min\\{|C|\\mid C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\sup C=\\kappa\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The minimizing family now ranges over unbounded subsets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(C\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span>; the former condition only bounded every member and never required cofinality.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is always a regular cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality function, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CofinalityMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cofinality-measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{CofinalityMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda=\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\lambda=\\min\\{|C|\\mid C\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\sup C=\\kappa\\}","display":true},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false}],"bytes":1122,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cofinality-measure.md|58-df-cofinality-measure]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["315ad00b8744fdfc","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}